直接修改当前挂载的装配并立即保存——修改无需进一步确认即在用户的装配中生效。返回已应用/被拒绝的修改以及修改后的数据与校验问题。修改操作：{"op":"add_module","slot_type":"high|medium|low|rig","type_id":<int>,"state":"active|online|passive|overload"?,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"remove_module","slot_type":...,"index":<int>}; {"op":"set_module_charge","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"charge_type_id":<int>?}; {"op":"set_module_state","slot_type":...,"index":<int>,"state":...}; {"op":"add_drone","type_id":<int>,"state":"bay|space"?}（默认 bay 舱内）; {"op":"remove_drone","type_id":<int>} 与 {"op":"set_drone_state","type_id":<int>,"state":"bay|space"} 作用于该型号的所有无人机；{"op":"add_fighter","type_id":<int>,"ability":<int 0-15>?}（ability 位掩码：1 攻击炮台、2 导弹、4 攻击导弹、8 炸弹；默认 0）; {"op":"remove_fighter","type_id":<int>}; {"op":"set_implant","type_id":<int>,"slot":<1-10>} / {"op":"remove_implant","slot":<int>}; {"op":"set_booster","type_id":<int>,"slot":<1-3>} / {"op":"remove_booster","slot":<int>}。植入体与增效剂的 `slot` 请取自 `search_items` 结果中的 `slot_index` 字段。请先使用 `search_items` 将装备名称解析为 `type_id`。
